<title>USA: N.Y. certificated cotton stocks rise to 193,745.</title>
<headline>N.Y. certificated cotton stocks rise to 193,745.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Certificated cotton stocks deliverable against New York Cotton Exchange's No. 2 cotton futures contract as of March 3 totaled 193,745 bales, up from 189,932 bales the previous session.</p>
<p>There were 3,824 bales issued, no decertification orders, 11 cancellations, and 4,785 bales awaiting review.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodity Desk, 212-859-1640</p>
</text>
